---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Map
seoTitle: "GTA 6 Map and Checklist: Regions of Leonida and a Collection Tracker"
description: "GTA 6 map checklist: track every collectible and activity count toward 100% and the trophies, and tick off the missions and things to do in each region of Leonida."
updated: 2026-11-18
---
<header class="mast" style="--glow:var(--cyan)">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="kicker">The world</p>
    <h1>Leonida</h1>
    <p class="tagline">GTA 6 takes place across the state of Leonida, with Vice City at its centre. Rockstar has named six regions so far.</p>
    <div class="chips"><span class="chip ok dot">Regions confirmed by Rockstar</span><a class="chip plain" href="#tracker">Collection tracker</a><a class="chip plain" href="#regions">Region checklist</a></div>
  </div>
</header>

<section class="sec" id="tracker">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="kicker">Map checklist</p>
    <h2 class="sec-h">Collection tracker</h2>
    <p class="lede">Count what you have found as you play. Each line shows what the 100% checklist and the trophy want. Type a number or use the buttons; it is saved in this browser.</p>
    <div class="progress" data-ctr-total>
      <div class="row"><span class="lab">Everything tracked</span><span class="pct"><span data-ctr-done>0</span> / <span data-ctr-max>0</span> · <span data-ctr-pct>0%</span></span></div>
      <div class="bar"><i></i></div>
    </div>
    {%- for g in tracker.groups %}
    <h3 class="ctr-h">{{ g.title }}</h3>
    <div class="ctrs">
      {%- for it in g.items %}
      <div class="ctr" data-count="{{ g.id }}:{{ it.id }}" data-max="{{ it.max }}">
        <div class="ctr-top"><a href="{{ it.u }}">{{ it.n }}</a><span class="ctr-v"><span data-val>0</span>/{{ it.max }}</span></div>
        <div class="bar"><i></i></div>
        <div class="ctr-row">
          <span class="ctr-meta">{% if it.pct %}100%: {{ it.pct }}{% endif %}{% if it.pct and it.trophy %} · {% endif %}{% if it.trophy %}<span class="ctr-tr">Trophy: {{ it.trophy }} ({{ it.tmax }})</span>{% endif %}</span>
          <span class="ctr-btns"><button type="button" data-dec aria-label="One less {{ it.n }}">−</button><input type="number" inputmode="numeric" min="0" max="{{ it.max }}" value="0" aria-label="{{ it.n }} found"><button type="button" data-inc aria-label="One more {{ it.n }}">+</button></span>
        </div>
      </div>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
    {%- endfor %}
    <p class="tsrc">Targets from the in-game 100% checklist and the PSN trophy list. More on each activity in <a href="/guides/activities-and-collectibles/">activities and collectibles</a>. <button class="reset" type="button" data-ctr-reset>Reset tracker</button></p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec" id="regions">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="kicker">Map checklist</p>
    <h2 class="sec-h">Region checklist</h2>
    <p class="lede">Pick a region to see the missions and things to do there, and tick them off. Ticks are shared with the walkthrough.</p>
    <div class="rtabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Regions">
      {%- for r in regions %}<button type="button" role="tab" class="rtab" data-rtab="{{ r.slug }}" aria-selected="{{ 'true' if loop.first else 'false' }}" aria-controls="rp-{{ r.slug }}">{{ r.short or r.name }}</button>{% endfor %}
    </div>
    {%- for r in regions %}
    {%- set ms = collections.missions | where("data.region", r.slug) %}
    {%- set acts = collections.all | activitiesIn(r.slug) %}
    {%- set ppl = cast | where("region", r.slug) %}
    <div class="rpanel" id="rp-{{ r.slug }}" role="tabpanel" data-rpanel="{{ r.slug }}"{% if not loop.first %} hidden{% endif %}>
      <div class="rpanel-head">
        <img src="/assets/img/post/{{ r.slug }}.webp" alt="{{ r.name }} postcard, official GTA 6 artwork" width="1200" height="675" loading="lazy">
        <div><p class="kicker">{{ r.kind }}</p><h3>{{ r.name }}</h3><p>{{ r.summary }}</p><a class="more" href="/map/{{ r.slug }}/">Region guide →</a></div>
      </div>
      <div class="rcols">
        <div>
          <h4>Missions here <span>{{ ms.length }}</span></h4>
          {%- if ms.length %}
          <ul class="rlist">{% for m in ms %}<li data-track-row><label><input class="cb" type="checkbox" data-track="mission:{{ m.data.slug }}"><a href="{{ m.url }}">{{ m.data.title }}</a></label></li>{% endfor %}</ul>
          {%- else %}<p class="nomatch">No mission guides placed here yet.</p>{% endif %}
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4>Things to do <span>{{ acts.length }}</span></h4>
          {%- if acts.length %}
          <ul class="rlist">{% for a in acts %}<li data-track-row><label><input class="cb violet" type="checkbox" data-track="try:{{ a.id }}"><a href="/activities/#{{ a.id }}">{{ a.t }}</a></label></li>{% endfor %}</ul>
          {%- else %}<p class="nomatch">Nothing tagged here yet.</p>{% endif %}
          {%- if ppl.length %}
          <h4>People here</h4>
          <ul class="rlist plain">{% for o in ppl %}<li><a href="/characters/{{ o.slug }}/">{{ o.name }}</a> <small>{{ o.role }}</small></li>{% endfor %}</ul>
          {%- endif %}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    {%- endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="cards three">
      {%- for r in regions %}
      <a class="card link region has-img" href="/map/{{ r.slug }}/"><img class="card-img" src="/assets/img/post/{{ r.slug }}.webp" alt="{{ r.name }} postcard, official GTA 6 artwork" width="1200" height="675" loading="lazy"><div class="card-body"><span class="pin">◉ {{ r.kind }}</span><h3>{{ r.name }}</h3><p>{{ r.summary }}</p></div></a>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
    <p class="fig-credit">Postcard artwork: Rockstar Games</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="kicker">The state</p>
    <h2 class="sec-h">Leonida at a glance</h2>
    <div class="facts">
      <div class="fact"><div class="k">Size</div><div class="v sm">About 2×<br><span class="u">GTA V's map</span></div><span class="chip ok dot">Confirmed</span></div>
      <div class="fact"><div class="k">Regions</div><div class="v">6</div><span class="chip ok dot">Confirmed</span></div>
      <div class="fact"><div class="k">Interiors</div><div class="v sm">Most in<br><span class="u">the series</span></div><span class="chip ok dot">Confirmed</span></div>
      <div class="fact"><div class="k">Neighbour</div><div class="v sm">Gloriana<br><span class="u">to the north</span></div><span class="chip ok dot">Confirmed</span></div>
    </div>
    <h2 class="sec-h sm" style="margin-top:34px">Places Rockstar has named</h2>
    <div class="castlist">{% for p in ["Ocean Beach","Little Cuba","VC Port","Tisha-Wocka flea market","Shore Drive","Washington Beach","Stockyard","Southside Vice City","Watson Bay","Gambit Bay","Lake Leonida","Leonida Penitentiary","Vercetti Estate","Shore Court","Mana Wynwood (real venue, launch festival)"] %}{% if not loop.last %}<span>{{ p }}</span>{% endif %}{% endfor %}</div>
    <p class="lede" style="margin-top:22px">More on the land and the weather on <a href="/wildlife/">Wildlife and weather</a>, and things to do on <a href="/activities/">Activities</a>.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="empty">
      <p class="kicker">Coming next</p>
      <h2 class="sec-h sm">An interactive map with pins</h2>
      <p>Rockstar has not put an official map online yet, and we only use official Rockstar images. As soon as there is one we can use, the tracker above gets a clickable map with a pin for every confirmed location.</p>
      <p style="margin-top:12px">For now, the fan-made <a href="https://map.stateofleonida.net/" rel="noopener">State of Leonida map</a> is a community project, not official.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
